msgid "Description"
msgstr "Popis"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:50
msgid ""
"This effect/filter applies arbitrary expressions to samples in frequency "
"domain. It is a Finite Impulse Response (FIR)\\ [1]_ filter using Fast "
"Fourier Transform (FFT)\\ [2]_."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter aplikuje ľubovoľné výrazy na vzorky vo frekvenčnej "
"oblasti. Je to filter s konečnou impulznou odozvou (FIR)\\ [1]_ používajúci "
"rýchlu Fourierovu transformáciu (FFT)\\ [2]_."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:54
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parametre"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:61
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:62
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Hodnota"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:64
msgid "Gain in Y / U / V plane"
msgstr "Zosilnenie v rovine Y / U / V"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:65
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Celé číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:66
msgid ""
"Set the gain value for the Y (:term:`luma`), U (1st :term:`chroma`) or V "
"(2nd chroma) plane. Allowed values are 0 to 250, default is 0."
msgstr ""
"Nastavuje hodnotu zosilnenia pre rovinu Y (:term:`luma`), U (1. :term:"
"`chroma`) alebo V (2. chroma). Povolené hodnoty sú 0 až 250, predvolená je 0."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:67
msgid "Luminance Y / U / V plane"
msgstr "Jas v rovine Y / U / V"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:68
msgid "Float"
msgstr "Reálne číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:69
msgid ""
"Set the frequency domain weight value for the Y (:term:`luma`), U (1st :term:"
"`chroma`) or V (2nd chroma) plane. Allowed values are 0.000 to 5.000, "
"default is 1.000."
msgstr ""
"Nastavuje hodnotu váhy frekvenčnej oblasti pre rovinu Y (:term:`luma`), U "
"(1. :term:`chroma`) alebo V (2. chroma). Povolené hodnoty sú 0.000 až 5.000, "
"predvolená je 1.000."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:70
msgid "Evaluate"
msgstr "Vyhodnotenie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:71
msgid "Selection"
msgstr "Výber"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:72
msgid "Set when the expressions are evaluated."
msgstr "Nastavuje, kedy sa výrazy vyhodnocujú."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:74
msgid "The following selection items are available:"
msgstr "K dispozícii sú nasledujúce položky výberu:"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:76
msgid ":guilabel:`Evaluate`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Vyhodnotenie`"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:83
msgid "init"
msgstr "Začiatok"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:84
msgid "Only evaluate expressions once during filter initialization (default)"
msgstr "Vyhodnocovať výrazy iba raz počas inicializácie filtra (predvolené)"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:85
msgid "frame"
msgstr "snímka"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:86
msgid "Evaluate expressions for each incoming frame"
msgstr "Vyhodnocovať výrazy pre každú prichádzajúcu snímku"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/fft-based_fir.rst:90
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Evaluate` is set to **frame** render times will be "
"significantly longer as each frame is evaluated individually."
msgstr ""
"Ak je :guilabel:`Vyhodnotenie` nastavené na **snímka**, časy renderovania "
"budú výrazne dlhšie, pretože každá snímka je vyhodnocovaná samostatne."

